{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人重天等中，畜生等下也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即八分銀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大沙門即比丘眾也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切比丘應稱某師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "半月誦比丘戒，平日講比丘戒，或作如法僧事，先遣未受具戒者出。一切不得盜聽，盜聽即成\n盜法重難。亦不得先自閱律及閱比丘戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘體是僧寶，故論戒臘。沙彌未預僧數，故論生年。縱使百歲沙彌，應敬初戒比丘也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若犯四根本戒，依師決疑，方可行取相懺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西土止一禮，無三拜法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "縵條謂無縫也，袈裟謂壞色也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或其處無梆，亦和婉說之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂受具戒後，復入外道中，今更來求受戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂他人受佛七眾戒法者，最初令其破根本戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂未受具戒，盜聽比丘說戒，及盜看比丘律藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂五種不男"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂一身有男女二根"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂龍猴等變為人形求受具戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂諸天修羅鬼神變人形求受具戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂曾受五戒、八戒、十戒、具戒之後，於殺人、盜五錢、邪婬、大妄語，隨犯一種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "家主與姓則得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "千里之外，改行從善則得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或償畢，或親友代償，或債主捨竟，皆得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "待滿二十則得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "病愈\n則得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "求聽則得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "食祿盡則得，王聽亦得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或借者許彼辯\n竟方還，不即索者則得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "周尺五尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "周尺四尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
